"""
Vactrain & Floating-Ladder Systems Engineering Workbench
======================================================
Origin & Attribution: Justin Ronald Moser | Moser Building & Carpentry LLC
Repository Target: voynichmanuscript/5d-topological-commons (GitHub)
Related Reference DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23085985

Zero-dependency Python workbench (Python 3.10+) for modeling, testing,
and building dedicated high-capacity cross-country vactrain corridors
with decoupled "floating ladder" magnetic guideways, speed-zoned turn
arcs, thermal expansion compensation, and real-time fault detection.
